<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 92,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 92,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual 92,000 and Saturday's 19,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts ranged steady to weak compared with mid-session Friday. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			    Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	     51.50 -52.50	   52.50 -53.50</p>
<p>few			 51.00  53.00	   52.00  54.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $2.50/up $1.50. Top $53.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.   41.00 -43.00	   42.50 -44.50</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs.   44.00 -46.00	   44.00 -46.50</p>
